 A Metal supported GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS version 11.0 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A Metal supported GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 2.0 ghz Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3.1 Ghz Quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660 / Radeon HD 7800<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Psychic Software"], "publishers": ["Psychic Software"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 2499, "final": 2499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$24.99"}, "packages": [459164], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy The Necromancer's Tale", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 459164, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "The Necromancer's Tale - $24.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 2499}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"i